OpenFlightClaims Multi-License Overview
========================================

This repository contains three distinct categories of intellectual property,
each governed by a different license:

1. Source code
   Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later.
   See LICENSE-CODE.md for the full license text.

2. Airline-link dataset and structured data exports
   Licensed under the Open Database License v1.0.
   See LICENSE-DATA.md for the full license text.

3. OpenFlightClaims name, logo, visual identity, and domain names
   NOT licensed for reuse. All rights reserved.
   See TRADEMARKS.md for the project trademark policy.

Third-party airline names, logos, and trademarks belong to their respective
owners. OpenFlightClaims does not claim ownership of any airline marks.

For a human-readable explanation of how these licenses work together, see
docs/licensing.md.

This is not legal advice.
